2. Maintains the exact same visual appearance and behavior
3. Keeps all styling and dimensions
4. Provides a fallback img tag for better compatibility
5. Preserves the original video fallback functionality

Key benefits:
- Component looks and behaves exactly the same
- All styling and functionality is preserved
- Works in both preview and production environments
- No configuration changes needed
- Maintains the component's integrity

